{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "64a3fbe5c4b5c9df37a1422bcc4e07cc721fbc633b64f51d99987c99f1f68f46", "ja": "暗い夜道に気をつけて☆", "zh": "注意黑漆漆的夜路☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c55b2c626e85c82979ace8c01e054cdc6e94f7a60778960a0723264619de48ec", "ja": "夜の山登りは新しい体験がいっぱい！\nハプニングはありつつも、全員で山頂を\n目指す。しかし疲労がたまってきた頃\n星梨花が足を滑らせてしまう。怪我は\n軽かったものの、いったん休憩することに。", "zh": "晚上登山充满新鲜事！\n虽然途中有些波折，全员仍一起迈向山顶。\n不过就在大家开始疲累时，\n星梨花不小心滑了一跤。\n尽管只有受轻伤，众人还是决定先休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bbd113e398769089913ed35de69ff9ce8fdb253efa79589c8a90c4c6e41d23f6", "ja": "（夜の登山……なだらかな山とルートを選んだつもり\nだけど、しっかり気を引き締めて引率しないとな）", "zh": "（在晚上登山……虽然我选了较为平缓的山跟路线，\n还是得绷紧神经带领大家才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "68acd74383651907e455808a4a9e462c12ab24123d0c524e7e2fda502f507b6d", "ja": "ふぉおおお……！\n山が……山がありさを呼んでいますよ～！", "zh": "唔喔喔喔喔……！\n是山……山在呼唤亚利沙啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "98590c2075f47318996fa9e49aef19b4d62878d7bec7cf4bbd21c32ec90fbaa5", "ja": "うわ～、夜の山ですよ、{$P$}さん！\n私、深呼吸してみようっと！　スー……ハー……。", "zh": "唔哇～是晚上的山耶，{$P$}先生！\n我来深呼吸看看！呼……哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "e2ead419eedf6deef5eb470cdf41f5ca00655d6d0d232f58c96bba33d23989f8", "ja": "すごい！　夜なのに、新鮮な感じがします！\nなんだかおいしいかも♪", "zh": "好神奇！明明是晚上，呼吸起来却觉得很新鲜！\n空气感觉好清新♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "934eadb8e98185ca3ea309c28c6e1845399c9e3d3782d7b80023a725c12ac41a", "ja": "わ、わたしもやってみます！　スー……ハー……。\n本当だ！　夜なのに、空気がおいしいです！", "zh": "我、我也来试试！呼……哈……\n真的耶！明明是晚上，空气却很清新！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "42af9d4cd1381bd1a8ed4ec4d2f2cb223c23799833c261787381d504ee0c2d2c", "ja": "空気が澄んでいるせいか、空もよく見えますね。\n夜だからっていうのも、関係してるんでしょうか。", "zh": "可能是因为空气很干净，天空也看得相当清楚。\n不知道是不是也跟晚上有关系呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0659a6e059b6788e094e5b05671407d60dc36c4c63ec5297c2337e8d8de95484", "ja": "俺も、詳しい事は知らないけど……\n夜の森は、昼間とは色々違うんだろうな。", "zh": "我也不是很清楚……\n不过晚上的森林，跟白天应该有许多不同吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "750de64838d7c0205d5fdab37ab27dbfdcea0ce27dd6af42c346ab5e7f80a43a", "ja": "みんな、時間はまだあるから、山を楽しみながら\n安全第一で、ゆっくり目的地を目指そう！", "zh": "各位，时间还很充裕，享受登山的同时，也要把安全\n放在第一优先，慢慢朝目的地前进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d16ca4d15d7474bfe7cfc56fd72b9146305425ae097891a4356f50d23191030c", "ja": "まずはみんなで、軽く準備体操をしておこうか？\nケガ防止のためにも、ちゃんと体を温めようね。", "zh": "首先，大家一起做个简单的暖身操吧。\n先暖好身也能避免受伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fc72c8577e3530e4e1963abca2f1ef5e83a74a23797ecf0f8cdf2a4cee86ee59", "ja": "あと、靴ずれだったり、足に違和感があったら\nすぐに言ってね。ひどくなる前に手当てをするから。", "zh": "还有，如果有人的鞋子磨脚，或是脚不舒服，\n要马上跟我说喔。我可以先处理伤口，避免伤势加重。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "6affa83973da20d4aa7c6c277447d5f826b59a96a09c141375766a3a338257e3", "ja": "はいっ！\n風花さんの手当て……ムフ、ムフフ……♪", "zh": "好的！\n由风花姊来包扎……唔呼、唔呼呼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "daf29d6b41e31ac0239bb9c52744d7c1f7ca89d10d748d3b18653640fc100ed8", "ja": "よし、用意を整えたら、出発だ！", "zh": "好，那准备好了就出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "7a5321b019e96e08e6175ae3b3dfdd493d7c42d23b7ecc76cfde87199758cbb6", "ja": "山登りは遠足でしたことありますけど、夜は\n初めてだから……なんか、ワクワクしちゃいますね♪", "zh": "我以前远足的时候有登过山，不过晚上登山\n还是第一次……总觉得有点兴奋呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "4b440cbac6560d28e3fb1f6d983486aa7260e231a2012ce192ca1310b1ae326c", "ja": "ライトに照らされたところ以外は真っ暗なんですね。\nひとりだったら、怖かったかもしれません。", "zh": "除了光照到的地方以外，都是黑漆漆的呢。\n如果我是一个人来，可能会很害怕吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "7596873519dc987218a5c9ac53fdf21622073d99315836506158ee5578be5b6f", "ja": "……ひゃっ！？", "zh": "……呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b76bc6f4e8218b667f6cff69ca3bf7f1abcb0d2690651718f6e1c675bb2852d8", "ja": "星梨花？", "zh": "星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d7e128df79efd81ffdd375c3f791cb860848db728694ae63a4a43d86bdb7fccc", "ja": "ど、どうしたの？\nもしかしてイノシシとか、タヌキとか？", "zh": "怎、怎么了？\n不会是有野猪或狸猫跑出来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "155f0f2dbca5a5e8634a9666dd1f27c1f0b6ba1d9be35e25908c8ca182549ba9", "ja": "な、なんでもないです……虫でした。\nライトに照らされて、影が大っきく見えたみたいです。", "zh": "没、没什么……是虫子。\n应该是被光照到之后，牠的影子看起来就特别大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "7a2ba30445beeb8ffc6879480a9b42e8bf6f3ad90e2146212c5f8a2427caa799", "ja": "虫がライトの光に反応して、寄ってきたんだね。", "zh": "是被灯光吸引过来的昆虫吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "e2ef25c719d2d2a36331f1ad0524372b6d546b64624bbf37ac903f9414f6480a", "ja": "やぁ～んっ！？\n虫は虫で、ありさ困りますぅ！", "zh": "呀啊～！？\n就算是虫子，亚利沙还是会怕啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "3d2560198493c1980b428f83431ee9bd10fc0592fdd3d302a0508297fd8ba5c5", "ja": "わ、わたしは平気です！　山なんですから、\n虫だって、タヌキだっているかもしれません！", "zh": "我、我不怕！毕竟这里是山上，\n虫啊、狸猫啊，都有可能出现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "141fdb227363d9f0e7879d0f1ad8d036d9b23aa60e4926df53e086bd71973e2b", "ja": "亜利沙さん。怖かったら、\nわたしが手をつないであげます！", "zh": "亚利沙姊姊，如果你害怕，\n我可以牵着你的手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "0cc6fd5da3869a53aba273cf3e962bb8fc08cc1e5ed707c54aa3b8b79ea8d692", "ja": "なんとっ！？　そ、そんなご褒美が……！", "zh": "什么！？竟、竟然有这种奖励……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "872707ff3d50e42813e91b0577fd0bfd7517eb6cec9215d6b9ebee31db8ff74e", "ja": "ありさ、夜の山に来て本当によかったです！\nもう何も怖くありません～！", "zh": "有到夜晚的山上来真是太好了！\n亚利沙已经什么都不怕了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "846bbffee08f705bf6fadfc0c9fa750a44129479a31838629d01052b69f45e40", "ja": "みんな、今日はミリオン流星群を見に来たことを\n忘れないようにな……？", "zh": "各位，可别忘了我们今天是来看\n百万流星雨的喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1025_null", "source_sha256": "7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2", "ja": "1時間後……", "zh": "一个小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "4b3717e8449451c5a0b0c317c21fd27f69f7776b06e64fbf66c5d9b836e27a5e", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……。", "zh": "呼哈……呼哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "a55e2c50e133f6e8a683d8cd507ede3661d6fa8c25e24166c5332bac4dc33b0f", "ja": "うう……、\nありさ、もうヘトヘトです～……。", "zh": "呜呜……\n亚利沙已经不行了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ffa12017b245ad1b6fd414891411c34d6d991be09ac5305f2c1b0f07c26d69a", "ja": "{$P$}、\n星梨花ちゃんや亜利沙の体力が、そろそろ……。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n星梨花跟亚利沙的体力也差不多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "6914e5c4e0853d2284db8e6044d263d531db486a24efc1ef5bb95c53732dd090", "ja": "そうだな。よし、この辺りで一度休憩を取ろう。", "zh": "说的也是。好，我们就在这附近休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1712f889760551980a4c4886911d9e9d637a9fa37e77d8361f5c595c5d744f76", "ja": "みんな、水分や糖分をしっかり取っておいてね。\n栄養補給も、ケガを防ぐのに大事だから。", "zh": "各位，记得充分摄取水分及糖分喔。\n为了避免受伤，补充营养也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "aa0ff4d122c853036a755d33713a578c6913a130a37b5fef3fd5696ad9ee8b6b", "ja": "劇場のレッスンと同じですね。\nこまめな休憩と栄養補給。勉強になります、風花さん。", "zh": "跟剧场的训练课程一样呢，需要时常注意\n休息及补充营养。我学到一课了，风花姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "ab0a2a295c0b7fd301f8a853872d1aa858014c1249b589b6134f0b5b779f91c9", "ja": "わぁ……。まだあんまり登ってないのに、\nここからでも街の明かりがキレイですね～。", "zh": "哇……还没有爬多久，\n从这里看出去的街景灯光就很漂亮了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "9f174c980b76ebd463354fcf52003d2632c8d7a9d1a8b34cd7bed9248342f0d5", "ja": "どこですか？\n未来さん、わたしも見たいです！", "zh": "在哪里啊？\n未来姊姊，我也想看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "f923d401aa349c26e67957ad128e56d5c3d4d5145a1ee9b96c241cf09e9c29b5", "ja": "あ、星梨花！　そのあたりは足場が……。", "zh": "啊，星梨花！那里的地上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "aa430f3969453ff929867980b2de00d2945a57c6c4fed7697a5d33d1d8c00850", "ja": "きゃっ！？", "zh": "呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "21203dce96cf444e8373693dba567e101a48e277ec1a1fac7b00176105916045", "ja": "はっ、星梨花ちゃん！？", "zh": "啊，星梨花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b2bff202df9e9ac44da4bb6a4681d0793d5a48b74f60b86b9850898350d6834", "ja": "星梨花！", "zh": "星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "6521c2d44d880f797a52c2579adac216e0897c02df23ad5e03b8f11076fa913f", "ja": "どうだ？　風花。", "zh": "风花，状况怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1039_041fuk", "source_sha256": "24b17f368f9d81071f9748cb0e833933e2f03c390e2f09e717c9f7feb858ec61", "ja": "足を岩にぶつけちゃったみたいですね。表面も少し擦り\nむいてますけど……。ん、大丈夫。捻挫はしてません。", "zh": "她应该是脚踢到岩石了，皮肤表面有些擦伤……\n嗯，不要紧，脚没有扭伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e076a63cc10d8b69408997630238df6f58f45fd77f0dc56fbedac3e8541dd4d8", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、痛いところはない？\n心配しなくても、大丈夫だからね。", "zh": "星梨花，还有哪里会痛吗？\n你不用担心，不要紧的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "4a8f17150bd3fbade1b52f0bd200ca4e7d994ab504c3963765e766f79ebf766a", "ja": "ああ、そうだぞ星梨花。\nいざとなったら、おんぶして連れていくからな。", "zh": "嗯，没错，星梨花。\n如果真的有万一，我会背你上去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "f7ed680d564c21f69732205a4126eb96774f8cbe09ddf871d0e6d069bde1bb3c", "ja": "はい……ありがとうございます、風花さん。\n{$P$}さん、みなさんも……。", "zh": "好的……谢谢你，风花姊姊。\n还有{$P$}先生跟大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "648b68b250f43a20f82fc040ca56b461f9fe4ce40a93b9710523ba5dd0c26998", "ja": "でも本当に、大きなケガがなくてよかった。", "zh": "不过，还好没有受到太重的伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1044_022ser", "source_sha256": "3c6d9c62b1f3203baeb5d43937e8b39c0a24b6b487e738ab6b17815e79343809", "ja": "はい。亜利沙さんがわたしの手を引っ張ってくれて……\nおかげで、擦りむいただけですみました。", "zh": "是啊，多亏亚利沙姊姊拉住我的手……\n我才只有轻微擦伤而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1045_022ser", "source_sha256": "a5ed614dd4aaf0d7e9aa7abbfa9bde85fa8dcc2064def6bc956da274584f85e0", "ja": "亜利沙さん、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "亚利沙姊姊，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1046_028ari", "source_sha256": "02e3be990dba999a2b6bb4fec6e191490691cb1889fe48220c242e1a30ceb950", "ja": "いえいえ、そんな……。ありさ、星梨花ちゃんと\n手をつないでて、よかったです！", "zh": "不会不会，不用道谢……\n还好亚利沙有跟星梨花牵手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1047_028ari", "source_sha256": "5ae98e5eead957004a92600c7914f57c1646b00735a037a04a21eaf1e85ec734", "ja": "それに、ありさが落っこちないよう、反対の手を\n引っ張ってくれたのは、未来ちゃんですから！", "zh": "而且是未来拉住了亚利沙的另一只手，\n让亚利沙不至于跌倒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1048_014mir", "source_sha256": "aa4041b6442b32556eb842ece0109c336f54d490e199bfc8520fa8418883cc68", "ja": "でへへ……♪　ビックリしたけど、\nふたりともケガしなくて、よかった！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪我吓了一跳呢，\n不过你们两个都没事，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "27a963e08baf6e44b6a3eafbcc6207a79382a595bf0707da5eb145917d05b065", "ja": "亜利沙、未来。ふたりともありがとう。\n星梨花、もうちょっと休んで様子を見てみような。", "zh": "亚利沙、未来，谢谢你们。\n星梨花，你再休息一下，看看身体状况吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1050_017kth", "source_sha256": "5b47ea707ac5c8ade78a46c041fafa565625f32b0c647d9d7a618572e132794f", "ja": "流星群の時間はまだ先だから、\n気にせず休んでてね、星梨花ちゃん。", "zh": "离流星雨的时间还很久，\n你就放心休息吧，星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1051_022ser", "source_sha256": "ff33ca14d2818f631babba2981b7646fb3b776c396447888a0693c4838df9951", "ja": "はい。\nみなさん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的。\n谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_03_1052_p", "source_sha256": "bf52c8d3c6d565d6692f184ce133da922454d9de7206709d12a140ff9192d3e6", "ja": "（夜の山では、安全確保が第一だ。今回は大丈夫\nだったけど……判断を間違えないようにしないとな）", "zh": "（在晚上的山中，确保安全是最重要的。\n这次虽然没出大事……但我绝对不能下错判断。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
